  "。包含雙北捷運、三鶯、淡海、安坑與機捷；TWD97 轉 WGS84。三鶯原快照仍標興建中，依": ". Covers Taipei/New Taipei metro, Sanying, Danhai, Ankeng, and Airport MRT; coordinates converted from TWD97 to WGS84. Sanying was still marked as under construction in the source snapshot and was included based on the",
  "官方 2026-06-30 通車公告": "official 2026-06-30 opening announcement",
  "納入。其他尚未開通站及出入口紀錄不當作獨立車站。": ". Other unopened stations and entrance records are not counted as separate stations.",
  "紐約：": "New York:",
  "地鐵與 Staten Island Railway，496 筆路線紀錄按站 ID 合併為 493 站。": "subway and Staten Island Railway. The 496 route records are merged into 493 stations by station ID.",
  "日本：": "Japan:",
  "國土交通省國土數值情報 N02-25": "MLIT National Land Numerical Information N02-25",
  "，基準日 2025-12-31，": ", reference date 2025-12-31,",
  "。站區線段取代表點、同組轉乘站合併。關西範圍：經度 135.08–136.02、緯度 34.48–35.18；東京近郊：經度 138.94–139.98、緯度 35.50–35.95。納入範圍內全部旅客鐵道、地下鐵、私鐵、單軌及路面電車；不代表整個日本或關東。": ". Station-area segments are represented by points, with related interchange stations merged. Kansai coverage: longitude 135.08–136.02, latitude 34.48–35.18; Tokyo suburbs: longitude 138.94–139.98, latitude 35.50–35.95. All passenger railways, subways, private railways, monorails, and trams within these bounds are included. This does not represent all of Japan or Kanto.",
  "官方路網供核對。": "official network maps are used for checking.",
  "台北歷史回顧": "Taipei History",
  "範圍為雙北捷運、淡海與安坑輕軌、機場捷運，包含 2026 年開通的三鶯線與廣慈／奉天宮站。170 個轉乘合併站、14 條含分支的線路、183 段真實站間路徑，28 次通車事件、31 個常態交路階段。歷史模式完全唯讀；可控制時間軸、查看運量及縮放地圖。": "Covers Taipei/New Taipei metro, Danhai and Ankeng light rail, and Airport MRT, including the Sanying Line and Guangci/Fengtian Temple station opened in 2026. Includes 170 merged interchange stations, 14 routes including branches, 183 real interstation paths, 28 opening events, and 31 regular service-pattern stages. History Mode is fully read-only; you can control the timeline, view ridership, and zoom the map.",
