  "下載官方軌道路徑整編 GeoJSON": "Download compiled official track geometry (GeoJSON)",
  "。依": ". Used under the",
  "政府資料開放授權條款第 1 版": "Open Government Data License, Version 1.0",
  "使用；已排除機廠支線並裁切營運端點。": "; depot branches are excluded and tracks clipped to operating endpoints.",
  "車站投影至實際軌道，保留彎道；轉乘複合站的遠端月台用官方個別站點定位。象山兩來源線位相差約 23 公尺，端點吸附接續；不補畫虛構站間直線。此為現有實際線位套用歷次開通範圍，並非逐年測繪的歷史地形或施工圖。": "Stations are projected onto real tracks, preserving curves. Distant platforms in interchange complexes use individual official station coordinates. The two Xiangshan geometry sources differ by about 23 meters; endpoints are snapped together rather than connected with invented straight tracks. Current track geometry is applied to historical opening extents; these are not annually surveyed historical terrain or construction drawings.",
  "線色與營運模式": "Line Colors and Service Patterns",
  "北捷 BR／R／G／O／BL 及環狀線 Y 採": "Taipei Metro BR / R / G / O / BL and Circular Line Y use",
  "現行官方網站 CSS 色值": "current official website CSS colors",
  "。淡海、安坑、三鶯取樣官方路網圖主色；機捷為官方 Pantone 的螢幕近似值，直達車紫色、普通車藍色。螢幕顯示可能與印刷色不同。": ". Danhai, Ankeng, and Sanying colors are sampled from official network maps. Airport MRT colors approximate official Pantone colors on screen: purple for express and blue for commuter services. Screen and print colors may differ.",
  "交路依官方各期營運資料呈現，包含早期淡水—新店、北投—南勢角直通，2013 信義線與 2014 松山線分線調整、兩條淡海交路、安坑區間車取消、機捷普通與直達停靠差異。": "Service patterns follow official information for each period, including early Tamsui–Xindian and Beitou–Nanshijiao through services, the 2013 Xinyi and 2014 Songshan line separations, two Danhai patterns, the cancellation of Ankeng short services, and different Airport MRT express/commuter stops.",
  "2013 官方營運技術資料": "2013 Official Operating Technical Data",
  "2014 官方營運技術資料": "2014 Official Operating Technical Data",
  "；各交路在介面另附來源。未知歷史班距保留空值，不能以現行班距回填。": "; sources are also linked for each service pattern. Unknown historical headways remain missing and are not backfilled with current headways.",
  "列車沿實際線位、依停靠站停留；畫面速度、車數、發車相位與停站秒數為視覺示意，不等於歷史實際時刻表。常態模式不重演納莉及 2024 環狀線震災停駛，也未完整收錄清晨深夜或特殊加班車。站名／站碼採現行版本供比對，不能理解為早期已使用現行代碼。": "Trains follow real tracks and stop at served stations. Display speed, train count, departure phase, and dwell times are illustrative, not historical timetables. Regular service displays do not reenact Typhoon Nari or the 2024 Circular Line earthquake suspension, and do not include every early/late or extra service. Current station names/codes support comparison and do not imply those codes were used historically.",
