  "桃捷逐月原始統計": "Original Taoyuan Metro Monthly Statistics",
  "共 53 筆年度記錄。各年加總實際月總量，沒有把平均日運量相加或推算成年值；2026 僅顯示已核對月份。統計單位是搭乘人次，不是不重複旅客人數。首年只涵蓋通車或正式收費期間；安坑排除免費試乘、淡海 2019 從 2 月收費起算。三鶯尚未納入可核對運量，顯示缺值。": "There are 53 annual records. Annual figures sum actual monthly totals; daily averages are neither added together nor extrapolated into annual totals. Only verified months appear for 2026. Units are passenger trips, not unique people. Opening-year totals cover only the operating or paid-service period. Ankeng excludes free trials; Danhai 2019 starts with paid service in February. Verified Sanying ridership is not yet included and is shown as missing.",
  "環狀線 2023 年完整數列與北捷移交前統計存在重疊，禁止跨系統直接相加。1996、1997 原始月表加總與市府早期年刊略有差異；本作保留原始月表版本，介面註明差額。資料缺值不等於零；不提供未經核實的逐線歷年運量。": "The full 2023 Circular Line series overlaps with Taipei Metro statistics from before the transfer; these systems must not be added directly. Original 1996/1997 monthly totals differ slightly from early city annual reports; the original monthly-table version is retained, with differences noted in the interface. Missing values are not zero. Unverified annual line-level figures are not provided.",
  "下載運量資料與逐筆來源": "Download ridership data and record-level sources",
  "香港、東京、紐約、大阪・京都歷史回顧": "Hong Kong, Tokyo, New York, and Osaka–Kyoto History",
  "核對至 2026-10-17；沿用台北唯讀播放器、大小設定鎖定、可動列車、日期選單及全站清單。現存站點依開通資料加入，採現行實際線位，沒有重建已廢止站、歷史遷線、全部舊站名或完整歷史交路。日本僅知年份的資料標「年度資料」，12 月 31 日只是排序截止日，不是實際通車日。未核對日期留空，只在今日完整路網顯示。": "Checked through 2026-10-17. Uses the same read-only player, locked display settings, moving trains, date selector, and full station list as Taipei. Surviving stations appear according to opening records on current track geometry. Closed stations, historical realignments, all former names, and complete historical service patterns have not been reconstructed. Japanese year-only records are marked as annual data; December 31 is a sorting cutoff, not an opening date. Unverified dates remain missing and appear only in today’s full network.",
